  "description": "The package named \"Safe.Secrets.Vault.On.Host.Directory\" securely stores the Secrets.json file in an encrypted file using OpenSSL and RijndaelManaged techniques. It safeguards the secrets within an encrypted database, allowing easy retrieval from anywhere within the application.",
